# Frontend Environment Configuration
# Expo automatically loads the correct file based on environment:
#   - npx expo start / npm run dev        → .env.development
#   - eas build / npx expo export         → .env.production
# 
# DO NOT commit .env.development or .env.production to version control

# For local development, copy .env.development to .env.local if needed
# For production, copy .env.production to .env